    "level": "SHORTS",
    "overview": "Fewer обычно используется с plural countable nouns, less — с uncountable nouns.",
    "main_rule": "fewer mistakes/employees/problems. less time/money/information. In measurement expressions less can be natural: less than ten minutes.",
    "form": "fewer + plural countable. less + uncountable.",
    "when_why": "Сначала определи grammatical type noun.",
    "examples": "We need fewer meetings. → Нам нужно меньше совещаний.\nWe need less paperwork. → Нам нужно меньше бумажной работы.\nIt took less than ten minutes. → Это заняло меньше десяти минут.",
    "special_cases": "В measurement expressions less common: less than five kilometres. Не выбирай только по тому, что в русском это «отдельные вещи».",
    "common_mistakes": "❌ less employees → ✅ fewer employees.\n❌ fewer information → ✅ less information.",
    "dont_confuse": "countable plural → fewer.\nuncountable → less.",
    "quick_summary": "fewer = countable plural.\nless = uncountable."
  },
